{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57464","headline":"诗 · 无名氏","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明月下山头，天河横戍楼。\n白云千万里，沧江朝夕流。\n浦沙望如雪，松风听似秋。\n不觉烟霞曙，花鸟乱芳洲。\n（以上均见《文镜秘府论》南卷《论文意》引王昌龄《诗格》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}